      <miscellaneous-field name="source-chart-text">Open C# Tuning: C# G# C# E# G# C#
 
Learnt it from this video of her playing it in
 an Instagram livestream:
https://youtu.be/TN2T1ttq1S4
 
A cover of me playing it, acoustic so may be a
 little easier to hear and figure it out:
https://youtu.be/LL6qvWoHRug
 
Edit: People pointed out to me that the 
G#maj11/G chord was missing. I've updated 
this, but I don't play it
in this cover. It's played for the last two 
measures of the bar before each D#m11 chord in
 the outro. It's
pretty clear to see in her video.
 
[Chords]
 
There's a lot and they have scary names but 
they're pretty simple are often variations of 
each other
 
   C#/G#    F#maj13    C#/E#    F#maj9   
F#maj9#11    A#m7       C#     F#add9    
G#add4   D#11sus2
 
