Picking pattern for the first half:
 
C#|--------------------------|
G#|-----------X-----------X--|
E#|-----X-----------X--------|
C#|--------X-----------X-----|
G#|--------------X-----------|
C#|--X-----------------------|
 
She varies this slightly (e.g. swapping when 
she picks the 6th string and 5th string when 
she moves between
F#maj9 and F#maj9#11) but it pretty much stays
 the same until the outro which she strums.
 

 
[Intro]
C#/G#   F#maj13   C#/E#   F#maj9   F#maj9#11  
 F#maj9   F#maj9#11
 
[Verse 1]
             C#/G#
